7fcac22963825","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone - I am selling my once-worn but like-new wedding dress. Here is my posting on preownedweddingdresses.com or feel free to contact me directly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/153204&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/153204&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.katiemay.com\/products\/lanai-gown&#039;&gt;Katie May Lanai gown&lt;\/a&gt;. I paid $1,800 total for it and I&#039;m selling for $1,100. The only alterations I made was having it hemmed (I&#039;m 5&#039;5\" and had it hemmed for 2\" heels) and putting in the bustle - so it could easily be taken in or out for it&#039;s next owner if needed. Payment through PayPal and I can cover shipping costs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(More pictures at the links above.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy to answer any questions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":33833,"Name":"9.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-79461100-1442689077.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-79461100-1442689077_thumb.jpg","Width":799,"Height":1200},{"Id":33834,"Name":"7.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-84282600-1442689253.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-84282600-1442689253_thumb.jpg","Width":799,"Height":1200}],"Id":1905056,"PostDate":1442674884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n       