iked":false,"PostKey":"fee8f238de4e08fd7700afa2e3d70346","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I purchased too many sashes and napkins therefore need to try and sell some of these.&amp;nbsp; All items are brand new and have never been used.&amp;nbsp; Prices below do not include shipping.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1) 50 yard fuchsia organza ribbon - 3\/8\" - $4&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2) 50 Teal Blue Organza Sashes - 8\"x108\" - $35&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3) 20 Orange Satin Solid Square Napkins - $15 (I was told these were 12x12 but they appear to be slightly smaller)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4) 20 Teal Blue Satin solid Square Napkins - $15 (I was told these were 12x12 but they appear to be slightly smaller)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Please let me know if you have any questions!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you :)\n Dacia&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1606831,"PostDate":1334241887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I purchased too many sashes and napkins therefore need to try and sell some of these.\u00a0 All items are brand new and have never been used.\u00a0 Prices below do not include shipping.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1) 50 yard fuchsia organza ribbon - 3\/8\" - $4<\/p> <p> 2) 50 Teal Blue Organza Sashes - 8\"x108\" - $35<\/p> <p> 3) 20 Orange Satin Solid Square Napkins - $15 (I was told these were 12x12 but they appear to be slightly smaller)<\/p> <p> 4) 20 Teal Blue Satin solid Square Napkins - $15 (I was told these were 12x12 but they appear to be slightly smaller)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please let me know if you have any questions!<\/p> <p> Thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> Dacia<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dacia99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1313286302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243840.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dacia","Id":243840,"Name":"Dacia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0819e4cb0a18c9c02df342c0d1f5fd7d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; The sashes have been sold!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1607673,"PostDate":1334468868,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The sashes have been sold!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dacia99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1313286302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243840.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":19